BT /F1 11 Tf 15 TL 56 786 Td
(Should Schools Ban Smartphones?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Smartphones have become the default companion of the modern teenager, and schools) Tj T*
(across the country are now debating whether to remove them from classrooms entirely. A) Tj T*
(full ban is the wrong answer. Schools should regulate phone use rather than prohibit) Tj T*
(it, because structured access teaches the self-regulation that students will need for) Tj T*
(the rest of their lives.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Critics of phones point to attention research, and they are not wrong about the data.) Tj T*
(Studies of classroom attention consistently find that students who keep a phone within) Tj T*
(reach perform worse on comprehension tasks. But this finding describes unmanaged) Tj T*
(access, not managed access. When a teacher builds a lesson around a phone-based polling) Tj T*
(tool, the same device that fragmented attention a moment earlier becomes the instrument) Tj T*
(that holds it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(There is also an equity argument that ban advocates rarely address. For many students,) Tj T*
(the phone in their pocket is the only computer their household owns. A blanket ban) Tj T*
(removes a research tool from exactly the students who have no replacement waiting at) Tj T*
(home, while wealthier classmates simply open a laptop.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Finally, banning phones outsources a skill that schools exist to teach. We do not) Tj T*
(respond to poor essay structure by banning writing; we teach structure. Attention is no) Tj T*
(different. A school that confiscates phones for four years graduates students who have) Tj T*
(never once practiced managing a device in a demanding environment.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The reasonable middle path is a tiered policy: phones away during instruction,) Tj T*
(available during collaborative work, and explicitly taught as a research tool. That) Tj T*
(policy respects the attention research, protects equity, and still leaves room for the) Tj T*
(lesson that matters most, which is learning when to put the thing down.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
